{
  "dashboard": {
    "annotations": {
      "list": []
    },
    "description": "A learning dashboard connecting aggregate image-resizer metrics in Prometheus with individual request traces in Tempo.",
    "editable": true,
    "graphTooltip": 1,
    "id": null,
    "links": [
      {
        "asDropdown": false,
        "icon": "dashboard",
        "includeVars": true,
        "keepTime": true,
        "targetBlank": false,
        "title": "Metrics overview",
        "type": "link",
        "url": "/d/image-resizer-overview/image-resizer-overview"
      },
      {
        "asDropdown": false,
        "icon": "logs",
        "includeVars": true,
        "keepTime": true,
        "targetBlank": false,
        "title": "Request logs",
        "type": "link",
        "url": "/d/image-resizer-logs/image-resizer-logs"
      }
    ],
    "liveNow": true,
    "panels": [
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "description": "Metrics summarize many requests; traces preserve the detailed timeline of one request.",
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 5,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0
        },
        "id": 1,
        "options": {
          "code": {
            "language": "plaintext",
            "showLineNumbers": false,
            "showMiniMap": false
          },
          "content": "## How to read this dashboard\n\nThe charts use **Prometheus metrics** to answer “what is the service doing over time?” The tables use **Tempo traces** to answer “what happened inside this particular request?”\n\nStart with request rate and latency, then click a **Trace ID**. The trace view shows the parent `POST /v1/resize` span and its `read upload → decode → resize → encode` child spans. From a selected span, use **Logs for this span** to jump to its correlated Loki log.",
          "mode": "markdown"
        },
        "pluginVersion": "12.3.1",
        "title": "Metrics lead you to traces",
        "transparent": true,
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "description": "All resize requests observed during the selected dashboard time range.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "fixedColor": "blue",
              "mode": "fixed"
            },
            "decimals": 0
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 5
        },
        "id": 2,
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "auto",
          "wideLayout": true
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "sum(increase(image_resizer_http_requests_total{namespace=\"image-resizer\",route=\"/v1/resize\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
            "instant": true,
            "legendFormat": "Requests",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Requests in time range",
        "type": "stat"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "description": "Percentage of requests that returned a successful response during the selected time range.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "decimals": 1,
            "max": 100,
            "min": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "orange",
                  "value": 90
                },
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": 99
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "percent"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 6,
          "y": 5
        },
        "id": 3,
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "auto",
          "wideLayout": true
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "100 * sum(increase(image_resizer_http_requests_total{namespace=\"image-resizer\",route=\"/v1/resize\",outcome=\"succeeded\"}[$__range])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(image_resizer_http_requests_total{namespace=\"image-resizer\",route=\"/v1/resize\"}[$__range])), 1)",
            "instant": true,
            "legendFormat": "Success",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Success percentage",
        "type": "stat"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "description": "Current 95th-percentile successful-request latency calculated over five minutes.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "decimals": 2,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "orange",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": 2.5
                }
              ]
            },
            "unit": "s"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 12,
          "y": 5
        },
        "id": 4,
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "auto",
          "wideLayout": true
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(image_resizer_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"image-resizer\",route=\"/v1/resize\",outcome=\"succeeded\"}[5m])) by (le))",
            "instant": true,
            "legendFormat": "p95",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Current p95 latency",
        "type": "stat"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "description": "Client rejections and server failures during the selected time range.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "thresholds"
            },
            "decimals": 0,
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "color": "green",
                  "value": null
                },
                {
                  "color": "orange",
                  "value": 1
                },
                {
                  "color": "red",
                  "value": 10
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 4,
          "w": 6,
          "x": 18,
          "y": 5
        },
        "id": 5,
        "options": {
          "colorMode": "value",
          "graphMode": "area",
          "justifyMode": "auto",
          "orientation": "auto",
          "reduceOptions": {
            "calcs": [
              "lastNotNull"
            ],
            "fields": "",
            "values": false
          },
          "textMode": "auto",
          "wideLayout": true
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "sum(increase(image_resizer_http_requests_total{namespace=\"image-resizer\",route=\"/v1/resize\",outcome=~\"rejected|failed\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)",
            "instant": true,
            "legendFormat": "Unsuccessful",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Unsuccessful requests",
        "type": "stat"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "description": "Per-second request rate separated by outcome. Metrics reveal traffic shape but do not explain an individual request.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "palette-classic"
            },
            "custom": {
              "axisCenteredZero": true,
              "axisColorMode": "text",
              "axisPlacement": "auto",
              "drawStyle": "line",
              "fillOpacity": 18,
              "gradientMode": "none",
              "hideFrom": {
                "legend": false,
                "tooltip": false,
                "viz": false
              },
              "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
              "lineWidth": 2,
              "pointSize": 5,
              "showPoints": "never",
              "spanNulls": true,
              "stacking": {
                "group": "A",
                "mode": "normal"
              },
              "thresholdsStyle": {
                "mode": "off"
              }
            },
            "min": 0,
            "unit": "reqps"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 8,
          "w": 12,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 9
        },
        "id": 6,
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "calcs": [
              "mean",
              "max"
            ],
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "sum(rate(image_resizer_http_requests_total{namespace=\"image-resizer\",route=\"/v1/resize\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (outcome)",
            "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
            "range": true,
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Request rate by outcome",
        "type": "timeseries"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "description": "Latency percentiles estimated from the request-duration histogram. A p95 spike is a good reason to inspect slow traces.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "palette-classic"
            },
            "custom": {
              "axisCenteredZero": false,
              "axisColorMode": "text",
              "axisPlacement": "auto",
              "drawStyle": "line",
              "fillOpacity": 8,
              "gradientMode": "none",
              "hideFrom": {
                "legend": false,
                "tooltip": false,
                "viz": false
              },
              "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
              "lineWidth": 2,
              "pointSize": 5,
              "showPoints": "never",
              "spanNulls": true,
              "stacking": {
                "group": "A",
                "mode": "none"
              },
              "thresholdsStyle": {
                "mode": "off"
              }
            },
            "min": 0,
            "unit": "s"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 8,
          "w": 12,
          "x": 12,
          "y": 9
        },
        "id": 7,
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "calcs": [
              "mean",
              "max"
            ],
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "bottom",
            "showLegend": true
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(image_resizer_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"image-resizer\",route=\"/v1/resize\",outcome=\"succeeded\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "p50",
            "range": true,
            "refId": "A"
          },
          {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(image_resizer_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"image-resizer\",route=\"/v1/resize\",outcome=\"succeeded\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "p95",
            "range": true,
            "refId": "B"
          },
          {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(image_resizer_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"image-resizer\",route=\"/v1/resize\",outcome=\"succeeded\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le))",
            "legendFormat": "p99",
            "range": true,
            "refId": "C"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Successful request latency",
        "type": "timeseries"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "description": "The 95th percentile for each processing stage. These names correspond directly to child spans in successful traces.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "color": {
              "mode": "palette-classic"
            },
            "custom": {
              "axisCenteredZero": false,
              "axisColorMode": "text",
              "axisPlacement": "auto",
              "drawStyle": "line",
              "fillOpacity": 10,
              "gradientMode": "none",
              "hideFrom": {
                "legend": false,
                "tooltip": false,
                "viz": false
              },
              "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
              "lineWidth": 2,
              "pointSize": 5,
              "showPoints": "never",
              "spanNulls": true,
              "stacking": {
                "group": "A",
                "mode": "none"
              },
              "thresholdsStyle": {
                "mode": "off"
              }
            },
            "min": 0,
            "unit": "s"
          },
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 8,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 17
        },
        "id": 8,
        "options": {
          "legend": {
            "calcs": [
              "mean",
              "max"
            ],
            "displayMode": "table",
            "placement": "right",
            "showLegend": true
          },
          "tooltip": {
            "mode": "multi",
            "sort": "desc"
          }
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "editorMode": "code",
            "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(image_resizer_processing_stage_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"image-resizer\"}[$__rate_interval])) by (le, stage))",
            "legendFormat": "{{stage}}",
            "range": true,
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Processing-stage p95 latency",
        "type": "timeseries"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "tempo"
        },
        "description": "Individual request traces stored in Tempo. Click a Trace ID to open its complete waterfall and inspect span attributes.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {},
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 12,
          "w": 24,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 25
        },
        "id": 9,
        "options": {
          "cellHeight": "sm",
          "footer": {
            "countRows": false,
            "fields": "",
            "reducer": [
              "sum"
            ],
            "show": false
          },
          "showHeader": true
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "limit": 50,
            "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"image-resizer-api\" && name = \"POST /v1/resize\" }",
            "queryType": "traceql",
            "refId": "A",
            "tableType": "traces"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Recent resize traces — click a Trace ID",
        "type": "table"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "tempo"
        },
        "description": "Requests whose root span exceeded the selected threshold. Compare waterfalls to identify the dominant stage.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {},
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 11,
          "w": 12,
          "x": 0,
          "y": 37
        },
        "id": 10,
        "options": {
          "cellHeight": "sm",
          "footer": {
            "countRows": false,
            "fields": "",
            "reducer": [
              "sum"
            ],
            "show": false
          },
          "showHeader": true
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "limit": 30,
            "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"image-resizer-api\" && name = \"POST /v1/resize\" && duration > $slow_threshold }",
            "queryType": "traceql",
            "refId": "A",
            "tableType": "traces"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Slow traces (> $slow_threshold)",
        "type": "table"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "tempo"
        },
        "description": "Rejected or failed request traces selected using the custom image.outcome span attribute.",
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {},
          "overrides": []
        },
        "gridPos": {
          "h": 11,
          "w": 12,
          "x": 12,
          "y": 37
        },
        "id": 11,
        "options": {
          "cellHeight": "sm",
          "footer": {
            "countRows": false,
            "fields": "",
            "reducer": [
              "sum"
            ],
            "show": false
          },
          "showHeader": true
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "limit": 30,
            "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"image-resizer-api\" && span.image.outcome =~ \"rejected|failed\" }",
            "queryType": "traceql",
            "refId": "A",
            "tableType": "traces"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Rejected and failed traces",
        "type": "table"
      }
    ],
    "refresh": "15s",
    "schemaVersion": 41,
    "tags": [
      "image-resizer",
      "tracing",
      "opentelemetry",
      "tempo"
    ],
    "templating": {
      "list": [
        {
          "current": {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "500ms",
            "value": "500ms"
          },
          "hide": 0,
          "includeAll": false,
          "label": "Slow trace threshold",
          "multi": false,
          "name": "slow_threshold",
          "options": [
            {
              "selected": false,
              "text": "250ms",
              "value": "250ms"
            },
            {
              "selected": true,
              "text": "500ms",
              "value": "500ms"
            },
            {
              "selected": false,
              "text": "1s",
              "value": "1s"
            },
            {
              "selected": false,
              "text": "2s",
              "value": "2s"
            }
          ],
          "query": "250ms,500ms,1s,2s",
          "skipUrlSync": false,
          "type": "custom"
        }
      ]
    },
    "time": {
      "from": "now-1h",
      "to": "now"
    },
    "timepicker": {},
    "timezone": "browser",
    "title": "Image Resizer Tracing",
    "uid": "image-resizer-tracing",
    "version": 1
  },
  "folderUid": "",
  "message": "Provision image-resizer metrics-to-traces learning dashboard",
  "overwrite": true
}
